WEBVTT

00:02:28.788 --> 00:02:31.496
And perhaps for good reason.

00:02:31.538 --> 00:02:34.746
It's long been the expectation
for people like me

00:02:34.788 --> 00:02:38.454
who have been grossly,
often intentionally,

00:02:38.496 --> 00:02:40.329
underrepresented at work

00:02:40.371 --> 00:02:46.204
to contort ourselves into this caricature
of what some call professionalism,

00:02:47.204 --> 00:02:52.621
and what we call a distorted elaboration
of white cultural norms

00:02:52.663 --> 00:02:54.621
and the standards that meet the comforts

00:02:54.663 --> 00:02:57.579
of those who hold
social and institutional power.

00:02:57.621 --> 00:02:59.163
That's professionalism.